  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] **\n**Given:**\n\n(sqrt{142}+52 div 26 ×5- sqrt{80}) ×2\n\n using the BODMAS rule,\n\n= ( 11.9 + **52*__ ÷ 26__*** × 5 - 8.9) x 2\n\n= ( 11.9 + __**2 × 5**__ - 8.9) x 2\n\n= ( 11.9 + __10__** - 8.9) x 2\n\n= *__(21.9 - 8.9)__ x**2***\n\n= __**13 x 2**__\n\n= 26\n\n**Hence, “option 4” is the correct answer.**",
